      "description": "Community guidelines for {{brand.name}}."
    },
    "report.html": {
      "title": "Report / takedown request, {{brand.name}}",
      "description": "Report content or request a takedown on {{brand.name}}."
    },
    "404.html": {
      "title": "Not found, {{brand.name}}",
      "description": "Page not found.",
      "robots": "noindex,nofollow"
    },
    "partners.html": {
      "title": "Why am I seeing this?, {{brand.name}}",
      "description": "Partner rooms are sponsored by the named company. {{brand.legalEntity}} runs the rooms. Moderation stays with {{brand.legalEntity}}.",
      "robots": "noindex,nofollow"
    }
  },
  "topics": {
    "seed": "topics/seed_wave1.json",
    "open": false,
    "showDoorways": false,
    "hubNoindex": false,
    "_doc": "Topic pages from the seed (HOLD rows never render). open=false: hidden topics show the not-live-yet state. showDoorways=false: no 'Also reachable at' line. hubNoindex=false (go-live 2026-11-04): hub pages are index,follow unless their pages entry sets robots; every topic page keeps the hide-until-active rule (only status active is indexable or in the sitemap). Set hubNoindex=true to put every page back under noindex,nofollow with an empty sitemap."
  }
